## NOTE: User Defined Gitignore Template

## Common Files/Folders to ignore
.DS_Store
__pychache__
node_modules

## Ignore headroom generated files
.tokensave/
.claude/.headroom_wrap_marker.json

## Ignore vscode extension artifacts
*.vsix

## Ignore .npm-cache folder
.npm-cache

## Built mkdocs output — DOCS.md documents this as git-ignored, but no rule
## actually covered it (found running a real `mkdocs build` this session).
src/pptxdiff/docs-site/site/

## Every src/packages/*/lib/ is a real, tracked Node source directory (each
## package's package.json "main"/"bin" points into it) — un-ignore them from
## the py.gitignore template's generic `lib/` rule (meant for Python
## virtualenv-style lib dirs), which would otherwise silently swallow them.
## Covers pptxdiff-cli, @pptxdiff/server, and any future src/packages/*/lib/.
!src/packages/*/lib/
!src/packages/*/lib/**

## Native-binary build output (src/packages/binaries/build.mjs) — the
## executable, the copied "assets" folder, and the zipped artifact are all
## generated per-OS, not source; keep each OS folder's own README.md tracked
## (it documents the folder before a build has ever run there) but ignore
## everything else build.mjs writes into it.
src/packages/binaries/pptxdiff-win/*
src/packages/binaries/pptxdiff-mac/*
src/packages/binaries/pptxdiff-linux/*
!src/packages/binaries/pptxdiff-win/README.md
!src/packages/binaries/pptxdiff-mac/README.md
!src/packages/binaries/pptxdiff-linux/README.md
src/packages/binaries/.build/
